WEBVTT

00:03.440 --> 00:05.160
(After being a substitute for so long,)

00:06.400 --> 00:07.440
(will I forget)

00:09.560 --> 00:10.680
(who I truly am?)

00:25.480 --> 00:26.960
(They call me He Rufei.)

00:27.320 --> 00:27.880
Kneel.

00:28.680 --> 00:30.200
(The eldest son of the He family.)

00:31.600 --> 00:32.720
(Since childhood,)

00:33.800 --> 00:34.960
(I was disguised as a boy.)

00:34.960 --> 00:36.000
(Visionary Foresight)

00:36.000 --> 00:37.600
(I've always had to wear a mask.)

00:38.480 --> 00:39.320
(They said,)

00:40.480 --> 00:41.040
("live")

00:41.920 --> 00:43.140
("without recognition")

00:44.240 --> 00:44.800
("and die")

00:46.000 --> 00:47.600
("without a trace.")

00:52.240 --> 00:52.800
(I hated it.)

00:52.800 --> 00:53.360
Remember.

00:54.400 --> 00:55.520
(Yet found solace too.)

00:57.160 --> 00:58.560
(This cold mask)

00:59.280 --> 01:00.240
(smothered my identity)

01:01.520 --> 01:02.920
(yet forged my purpose.)

01:07.040 --> 01:08.080
(Amidst the smoke of war)

01:08.720 --> 01:09.800
(and seas of blood,)

01:10.840 --> 01:11.960
(I forgot life and death)

01:12.880 --> 01:14.000
(and stopped wondering)

01:14.600 --> 01:15.760
(who I am)

01:16.480 --> 01:17.600
(beneath the mask.)

01:20.680 --> 01:22.480
(From a nameless foot soldier,)

01:23.840 --> 01:24.480
(I fought)

01:24.480 --> 01:26.400
(to become
the invincible General Feihong.)

01:31.120 --> 01:32.160
(But in the end,)

01:32.880 --> 01:34.280
(who is General Feihong?)

01:35.440 --> 01:35.960
(Who)

01:37.800 --> 01:38.680
(am I?)

01:56.850 --> 01:59.660
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

01:59.660 --> 02:02.240
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

02:02.910 --> 02:06.320
♪Release and find wider shores♪

02:08.020 --> 02:11.020
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

02:11.400 --> 02:13.920
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

02:14.270 --> 02:17.700
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

02:19.460 --> 02:24.680
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

02:25.360 --> 02:30.440
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

02:31.230 --> 02:33.730
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

02:33.730 --> 02:36.340
♪Through wandering exile♪

02:36.850 --> 02:44.120
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

02:45.090 --> 02:47.840
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

02:47.900 --> 02:50.740
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

02:51.040 --> 02:52.060
♪Let me♪

02:52.260 --> 02:56.340
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

02:56.790 --> 02:59.470
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

02:59.750 --> 03:02.450
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

03:02.620 --> 03:04.090
♪Hands held tight♪

03:04.090 --> 03:08.270
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

03:08.620 --> 03:18.880
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

03:20.310 --> 03:26.020
=Legend of The Female General=

03:26.020 --> 03:29.150
=Episode 1=

03:30.079 --> 03:31.680
(In the 20th year
of Wei's Qingyuan era,)

03:32.240 --> 03:33.600
(Battlefield of Mingshui)
(Wutuo invaded Wei again.)

03:35.079 --> 03:35.880
(Emperor Chengping)

03:36.240 --> 03:37.720
(ordered General Xiao Zhongwu,)

03:37.720 --> 03:38.720
(Xiao Army's commander)

03:39.200 --> 03:40.480
(who beat Wutuo five years ago,)

03:41.000 --> 03:42.079
(Xiao Zhongwu, Xiao Army's Commander)
(to march to battle.)

03:43.320 --> 03:44.720
(But at Mingshui's final battle,)

03:45.600 --> 03:47.000
(30,000 Xiao troops)

03:47.640 --> 03:48.880
(fell into an ambush.)

03:52.640 --> 03:53.440
Xiao Zhongwu,

03:53.760 --> 03:54.920
He Rufei's Fuyue Army

03:55.200 --> 03:56.040
won't be coming.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.560
Surrender,

03:57.920 --> 03:59.240
and we'll spare you.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.720
He Rufei

04:02.560 --> 04:04.040
will come without fail!

04:04.560 --> 04:07.120
Wei soldiers

04:10.960 --> 04:13.800
choose death over surrender.

04:15.760 --> 04:16.959
Charge!

04:37.200 --> 04:38.000
General Xiao!

04:39.840 --> 04:40.640
General Xiao!

04:47.000 --> 04:47.920
General Xiao!

04:54.400 --> 04:54.920
Father!

05:03.510 --> 05:05.800
(Xiao Jue, styled Huaijin,
General Fengyun)

05:05.800 --> 05:06.840
He Rufei,

05:07.140 --> 05:08.240
(General Feihong of Wei)

05:08.240 --> 05:10.200
Huayuan is less than a hundred li
from Mingshui.

05:11.080 --> 05:12.840
Why has your reinforcement
arrived so late?

05:23.640 --> 05:24.600
A rope saws wood.

05:24.840 --> 05:25.920
Water penetrates stones.

05:26.760 --> 05:27.600
One day,

05:27.960 --> 05:29.240
you two will become

05:29.240 --> 05:30.080
Wei's Twin Stars.

05:30.800 --> 05:31.680
With joint forces,

05:32.240 --> 05:34.080
you shall wield the swords
to guard our land

05:34.600 --> 05:35.440
and its people.

05:49.000 --> 05:49.760
You are unworthy

05:49.800 --> 05:51.960
of the Qinglang Sword
my father entrusted to you.

06:03.840 --> 06:05.440
(Yaojing City)
General Feihong's returned triumphantly!

06:06.000 --> 06:06.720
General Feihong!

06:07.600 --> 06:09.240
Welcome, General Feihong!

06:09.310 --> 06:19.260
(General Feihong's Mansion)

06:44.840 --> 06:45.440
Young Master,

06:45.760 --> 06:47.200
the Master awaits you in his study.

06:59.000 --> 06:59.520
Ermao.

07:03.440 --> 07:03.960
Madam,

07:04.480 --> 07:05.320
now that you're here,

07:05.400 --> 07:06.520
visit the Young Lady.

07:07.760 --> 07:08.480
Watch your tongue.

07:09.480 --> 07:10.720
There is only the Young Master.

07:11.560 --> 07:12.320
The Young Lady...

07:13.950 --> 07:14.940
(Tang Jia, He Yan's mother)

07:16.920 --> 07:18.400
She's recuperating at Yuhua Temple.

07:35.240 --> 07:35.780
Sit.

07:41.000 --> 07:41.680
Yan,

07:42.400 --> 07:43.480
you've been away for years,

07:44.000 --> 07:46.480
(He Yuansheng, He Yan's father)
enduring military hardships.

07:47.880 --> 07:48.800
It must have been hard.

07:49.840 --> 07:50.440
Father,

07:50.840 --> 07:51.720
it's not hard at all.

07:52.440 --> 07:53.480
Honoring our family

07:53.800 --> 07:54.680
fills me with joy.

07:55.720 --> 07:56.290
Yan,

07:57.200 --> 07:58.960
I'm glad you're home.

07:59.520 --> 08:00.480
For a young lady,

08:00.520 --> 08:01.560
to wield weapons

08:01.960 --> 08:02.880
is improper.

08:03.280 --> 08:04.160
Honoring the family

08:04.360 --> 08:06.000
should be men's duty.

08:07.880 --> 08:08.760
Now that you're back,

08:09.080 --> 08:10.760
it's time to embrace your true identity

08:10.800 --> 08:11.680
as a woman.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.080
About our family's title,

08:13.360 --> 08:14.400
you don't need to worry.

08:14.720 --> 08:16.320
I have a solution.

08:17.840 --> 08:18.480
A solution?

08:19.480 --> 08:20.240
What solution?

08:20.640 --> 08:21.360
You've sacrificed

08:21.360 --> 08:22.520
for our family for years.

08:22.880 --> 08:23.880
It's been tough for you.

08:26.720 --> 08:27.760
From now on,

08:28.200 --> 08:29.480
let me handle these matters.

08:33.320 --> 08:34.159
This is

08:34.280 --> 08:35.760
your brother you never met,

08:35.880 --> 08:36.520
(He Rufei, He Yan's elder brother)
He Rufei.

08:37.280 --> 08:37.919
When you came

08:37.919 --> 08:39.320
with your mother at three,

08:39.400 --> 08:40.600
due to his congenital frailty,

08:41.200 --> 08:42.880
he had been recuperating
at Yuhua Temple.

08:43.320 --> 08:45.320
That's why you had to replace him.

08:46.080 --> 08:46.760
Now

08:46.880 --> 08:48.280
your brother has fully recovered

08:48.480 --> 08:49.160
and returned.

08:49.840 --> 08:50.920
Both of you

08:51.160 --> 08:52.680
should return to your proper places.

08:53.200 --> 08:53.920
Our family's act

08:54.280 --> 08:55.560
of replacing a son

08:55.720 --> 08:56.400
with a daughter

08:56.440 --> 08:58.320
can then be quietly erased.

09:02.360 --> 09:02.960
Father,

09:05.320 --> 09:06.480
is this your solution?

09:10.480 --> 09:11.040
Yan,

09:11.520 --> 09:13.120
you must consider
our family's interests.

09:13.480 --> 09:14.240
Our family

09:14.640 --> 09:16.480
is a pillar of Confucian academia

09:16.760 --> 09:17.760
and a leader in literary.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.800
Now, abandoning culture
for martial pursuits,

09:21.320 --> 09:21.880
- we...
- Father.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.520
It was precisely to not disappoint you

09:25.160 --> 09:25.680
and to guard

09:25.680 --> 09:26.720
our family's honor

09:27.680 --> 09:29.280
that I strove to achieve military glory.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.680
I hoped that one day

09:31.080 --> 09:33.040
I'd become a hero
like General Xiao Zhongwu.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.840
You wished to emulate Xiao Zhongwu?

09:37.040 --> 09:38.960
Xiao Zhongwu was a traitor to Wei.

09:39.440 --> 09:41.360
It was all due to his reckless ambition

09:41.640 --> 09:42.760
and warmongering.

09:43.800 --> 09:44.760
Soldiers wield swords

09:45.480 --> 09:46.280
to guard the land

09:47.120 --> 09:47.960
and its people.

09:48.920 --> 09:50.400
General Xiao taught me those words.

09:51.480 --> 09:52.280
I refuse to believe

09:52.920 --> 09:54.680
he was a warmonger.

09:55.720 --> 09:56.800
Tomorrow, I'll attend court

09:57.440 --> 09:59.200
and demand justice for General Xiao.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.680
Even at the cost of my military honors,

10:02.200 --> 10:03.240
I won't hesitate.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.360
(Wei's Imperial Palace)
(In Mingshui Battle,)

10:12.880 --> 10:16.200
(Wei lost over 30,000 soldiers.)

10:16.800 --> 10:19.520
Commander Xiao Zhongwu
bears full responsibility.

10:19.880 --> 10:23.320
(Emperor Chengping of Wei)
The Xiaos shall bury him as a commoner

10:23.840 --> 10:26.560
and be stripped of military command

10:27.080 --> 10:29.360
as punishment.

10:31.440 --> 10:32.030
Your Majesty,

10:33.000 --> 10:33.840
my father

10:34.480 --> 10:36.280
was no warmonger.

10:37.040 --> 10:37.760
Our army had

10:37.800 --> 10:38.920
ambushes set

10:38.920 --> 10:39.800
throughout Mingshui.

10:40.800 --> 10:42.080
Yet on the day of battle,

10:42.960 --> 10:43.800
the Wutuo people

10:44.280 --> 10:46.680
somehow destroyed
all ambush points beforehand.

10:47.360 --> 10:49.080
There must have been
a leak of intelligence.

10:49.640 --> 10:51.840
I implore Your Majesty
to reopen this case

10:52.640 --> 10:53.880
to clear my father's name

10:54.600 --> 10:56.160
and restore justice

10:57.680 --> 10:58.680
for Xiao Army soldiers.

10:59.640 --> 11:01.200
By imperial decree,

11:01.520 --> 11:06.040
summon General Feihong, He Rufei.

11:29.280 --> 11:32.840
I, He Rufei,
pay respects to Your Majesty.

11:35.320 --> 11:35.840
Rise.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.160
Thank you.

11:40.440 --> 11:41.040
General He,

11:41.480 --> 11:42.320
in Mingshui Battle,

11:42.600 --> 11:43.720
was there more

11:43.920 --> 11:44.880
to Xiao Army's defeat?

11:45.720 --> 11:46.600
Your Majesty,

11:47.240 --> 11:48.280
there was no more story

11:49.280 --> 11:50.440
to Mingshui Battle.

11:51.560 --> 11:52.840
If not for General Xiao's

11:52.840 --> 11:54.080
reckless pursuit of glory

11:54.600 --> 11:56.160
and direct confrontation with Wutuo,

11:56.440 --> 11:57.520
coupled with his refusal

11:57.520 --> 11:59.280
to request aid from our Fuyue Army,

11:59.680 --> 12:01.840
how could the battle
have turned so tragic?

12:04.120 --> 12:05.760
He Rufei!

12:06.880 --> 12:07.840
General Fengyun,

12:08.120 --> 12:09.520
I tried to reason with you.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.640
Yet, to absolve your father's sins,

12:11.840 --> 12:12.960
you twisted the truth

12:13.000 --> 12:14.400
and made baseless accusations.

12:14.880 --> 12:16.440
I mobilized troops immediately

12:16.640 --> 12:18.120
upon receiving the distress message

12:18.240 --> 12:19.680
without a moment's hesitation.

12:19.720 --> 12:21.240
He Rufei,

12:23.280 --> 12:24.680
after all these years apart,

12:27.560 --> 12:29.520
why did you become so wretched?

12:45.760 --> 12:46.680
You dare attempt

12:46.680 --> 12:48.280
to plead for a sinner?

12:48.600 --> 12:49.120
You're

12:49.320 --> 12:51.040
dragging our entire family to graves.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.080
- Father.
- (I've meticulously imitated)

12:52.240 --> 12:54.840
(your handwriting
and behavioral patterns.)

12:54.920 --> 12:55.560
(Imitating?)

12:55.640 --> 12:58.800
(Since you're unwilling to swap identities,
we'll talk about it later.)

12:58.840 --> 13:00.640
(You've sacrificed
a lot for your brother.)

13:00.840 --> 13:01.560
(It's been tough.)

13:02.280 --> 13:05.360
(Let your brother express
his gratitude to you)

13:05.800 --> 13:06.920
(and have this cup of tea.)

13:22.320 --> 13:25.280
General Fengyun
breached court etiquette.

13:25.840 --> 13:29.760
But His Majesty acknowledges
the Xiao family's military merits.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.800
As a warning, he shall be punished

13:32.120 --> 13:33.360
with 20 strokes

13:34.200 --> 13:37.040
and kneel outside the hall till dawn

13:37.400 --> 13:39.760
to reflect on his transgressions.

13:55.730 --> 13:58.340
(Memorial Tablet of Mother, Song Wan;
Memorial Tablet of Father, Xiao Zhongwu)

14:08.370 --> 14:09.860
(People's Guardian of Loyalty and Valor)

14:25.080 --> 14:26.440
(People's Guardian of Loyalty and Valor)

14:30.720 --> 14:32.480
Punishment carried out.

14:49.920 --> 14:50.560
Your Majesty,

14:51.400 --> 14:52.560
I admit fault.

14:53.600 --> 14:55.640
I request to lead troops to Que City

14:56.440 --> 14:57.640
to reclaim our lost territory

14:58.680 --> 14:59.960
and atone for my sins.

15:11.920 --> 15:12.520
Your Majesty,

15:12.720 --> 15:14.720
I'll sign a military pledge.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.840
If Que City isn't reclaimed,

15:18.200 --> 15:19.240
I vow never to return.

15:36.520 --> 15:37.840
General Fengyun,

15:38.200 --> 15:41.440
(Xu Jingfu, Prime Minister of Wei)
His Majesty has granted your request.

15:44.760 --> 15:46.280
Gratitude to Your Majesty.

15:48.560 --> 15:50.400
However, Wei's soldiers

15:50.560 --> 15:53.440
shall not be sent to futile deaths.

15:54.600 --> 15:55.560
Xiao Jue,

15:56.000 --> 15:59.200
the court won't provide any troops.

15:59.560 --> 16:01.480
Recover the territory

16:02.200 --> 16:04.160
through your own means.

16:08.680 --> 16:09.360
I

16:09.880 --> 16:10.600
accept the decree.

16:12.920 --> 16:13.800
Thanks, Your Majesty.

16:33.800 --> 16:35.840
(Even if at the cost of all,)

16:36.720 --> 16:40.480
(I will clear my father's name.)

16:44.920 --> 16:49.570
(Several days later)

16:54.610 --> 16:59.010
(Yuhua Temple)

17:08.040 --> 17:08.720
Miss.

17:11.800 --> 17:12.480
Miss.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.440
Take a walk with me by the roses.

17:15.079 --> 17:15.740
Okay.

17:19.520 --> 17:20.280
Be careful.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.319
There are steps ahead.

17:32.320 --> 17:34.560
(59, 60,)

17:35.640 --> 17:36.360
(61...)

17:39.040 --> 17:40.200
You're so straightforward,

17:40.680 --> 17:42.560
unlike the delicate noble ladies

17:42.680 --> 17:43.480
visiting the temple.

17:47.560 --> 17:48.120
Yixin,

17:49.720 --> 17:50.400
if I turn right

17:51.240 --> 17:51.960
and go forward,

17:52.400 --> 17:52.920
will it lead

17:53.000 --> 17:54.120
to the rear courtyard wall?

17:55.280 --> 17:56.640
Yes, it'll be the rear wall.

17:56.920 --> 17:59.080
Beyond lies the hidden path I use

17:59.080 --> 17:59.960
to leave here.

18:00.640 --> 18:01.640
Past the canyon crevice,

18:01.840 --> 18:03.280
it'll be beyond Yuhua Temple.

18:05.200 --> 18:06.200
Show me around.

18:07.080 --> 18:07.780
Okay.

18:14.640 --> 18:17.220
(Ding Yi, He Rufei's guard)

18:18.680 --> 18:20.280
Father showed mercy and spared her life

18:21.120 --> 18:22.480
due to family ties.

18:23.280 --> 18:25.120
But even blinded by poison,

18:25.680 --> 18:27.480
she remains a threat.

18:28.440 --> 18:30.080
I'll send her to Yuhua Temple first.

18:30.640 --> 18:31.640
Watch her closely.

18:32.760 --> 18:33.920
Spread that word

18:34.200 --> 18:36.560
that Miss He's condition
has suddenly worsened.

18:38.600 --> 18:39.760
Then...

18:42.400 --> 18:43.960
I will handle it impeccably.

18:53.000 --> 18:54.320
(From meditation room to bridge,)

18:54.680 --> 18:55.640
(it takes 61 steps.)

18:59.560 --> 19:00.680
(After the bridge)

19:01.240 --> 19:02.160
(and seven more steps,)

19:02.880 --> 19:04.280
(I'll reach the roses by the pond.)

19:05.080 --> 19:06.680
(Then bypass the roses and turn right.)

19:14.080 --> 19:15.960
(Did I miscalculate my stride today?)

19:17.600 --> 19:18.640
(Or did I miscount?)

19:56.200 --> 19:56.720
Who are you?

19:58.920 --> 19:59.600
Forgive me, miss.

19:59.880 --> 20:00.440
I am merely

20:01.240 --> 20:02.680
a devotee visiting this temple.

20:03.120 --> 20:03.720
No offense.

20:04.840 --> 20:07.200
Yuhua Temple's back courtyard
lies in the northwest corner.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.280
Devotees' meditation rooms

20:10.000 --> 20:11.040
are in the eastern part.

20:13.800 --> 20:14.560
It seems you think

20:14.920 --> 20:16.240
that I harbor ill intentions.

20:17.320 --> 20:18.760
If you truly wish to die,

20:19.520 --> 20:21.360
why care about my potential harm?

20:22.720 --> 20:24.120
(Wishing to die?)

20:24.800 --> 20:25.720
Our parents gave us

20:26.200 --> 20:26.960
our physical forms.

20:28.760 --> 20:30.480
One more step and you'd enter the pond.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.040
If you disrespect life so casually

20:34.000 --> 20:35.760
and disregard
your parents' nurturing grace,

20:36.880 --> 20:38.280
then proceed as you will.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.080
I won't stop you.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.960
Nurturing grace?

20:45.120 --> 20:46.520
They denied me even the chance

20:46.560 --> 20:47.280
to speak.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.640
They blinded me and abandoned me here.

20:51.120 --> 20:52.080
In that case,

20:53.720 --> 20:54.440
my life

20:55.160 --> 20:56.320
is now mine to command.

20:57.680 --> 20:58.680
In desperation,

21:00.360 --> 21:00.920
death

21:02.440 --> 21:03.600
becomes easier than living.

21:04.920 --> 21:05.800
If you're truly tough,

21:05.880 --> 21:06.840
blindness matters not.

21:08.400 --> 21:09.160
Even blind,

21:09.960 --> 21:10.880
aim to be

21:12.080 --> 21:13.080
the most special of all.

21:17.960 --> 21:18.720
Give me your hand.

21:26.920 --> 21:28.160
This osmanthus candy

21:29.440 --> 21:32.000
is the last piece left in the world.

21:34.880 --> 21:36.000
Though inedible now,

21:37.040 --> 21:38.000
it remains sweet.

21:42.120 --> 21:42.840
I won't know

21:43.200 --> 21:43.960
until I taste it.

21:46.480 --> 21:48.560
Though bitter at first taste,

21:48.920 --> 21:50.840
its core holds enduring sweetness.

21:55.360 --> 21:56.360
Is the moon tonight

21:58.440 --> 21:59.160
beautiful?

22:12.440 --> 22:13.600
Bright moon like frost.

22:15.600 --> 22:16.680
Gentle breeze like water.

22:19.080 --> 22:20.520
The serene beauty is endless.

22:35.760 --> 22:36.920
I moved the roses

22:37.360 --> 22:39.680
to stage an accidental drowning

22:40.120 --> 22:41.440
for Young Lady at Yuhua Temple.

22:42.080 --> 22:42.840
But Young Lady

22:43.240 --> 22:44.320
was pulled back by Xiao Jue

22:45.480 --> 22:46.520
and avoided falling.

22:46.880 --> 22:47.800
Why would Xiao Jue

22:47.800 --> 22:48.720
appear there?

22:50.240 --> 22:51.480
No matter who intervenes,

22:51.880 --> 22:53.320
that woman cannot be saved.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.440
Let her escape then

23:01.400 --> 23:02.600
and die

23:02.920 --> 23:04.680
on her way to appeal to the emperor.

23:18.480 --> 23:20.480
(Beyond lies the hidden path I use)

23:20.480 --> 23:21.400
(to leave here.)

23:22.200 --> 23:24.640
(Past the canyon crevice,
it'll be beyond Yuhua Temple.)

23:57.080 --> 24:00.520
Young Lady, let me send you
on your final journey.

24:01.600 --> 24:04.120
In your next life,
avoid being born a He.

24:49.680 --> 24:51.360
Your continued existence
remains a threat

24:51.360 --> 24:52.320
to the He family.

24:53.160 --> 24:54.080
A mere woman

24:54.440 --> 24:55.920
daring to seek military glory?

24:56.560 --> 24:58.080
Preposterous delusions!

25:39.280 --> 25:43.260
(One month later)

26:18.280 --> 26:19.280
(I can see again.)

26:33.120 --> 26:33.960
(Where am I?)

26:35.120 --> 26:36.240
(Didn't I die?)

26:53.560 --> 26:54.960
With great effort,

26:54.960 --> 26:55.520
I saved you

26:55.880 --> 26:56.960
and restored your vision.

26:57.200 --> 26:58.040
Why do you

26:58.080 --> 26:58.760
keep moving?

26:59.880 --> 27:00.640
Master.

27:01.040 --> 27:03.040
(Liu Buwang, He Yan's master)

27:05.320 --> 27:06.840
Last I saw you so weakened

27:07.480 --> 27:08.600
was when I rescued you

27:09.160 --> 27:10.640
from that mountain of corpses

27:11.000 --> 27:12.120
on the battlefield.

27:12.560 --> 27:13.240
Why ended up

27:13.280 --> 27:14.120
like that again?

27:17.280 --> 27:17.960
I thought

27:18.840 --> 27:20.240
I could survive.

27:23.320 --> 27:24.000
Unexpectedly,

27:25.240 --> 27:26.560
I misjudged human nature.

27:28.400 --> 27:30.000
They didn't just silence me

27:32.760 --> 27:33.840
but sought to ensure

27:35.120 --> 27:36.440
I'd never speak again.

27:39.320 --> 27:40.240
Your family

27:40.680 --> 27:41.800
has mastered the art

27:42.440 --> 27:43.760
of deception to perfection.

27:51.840 --> 27:52.400
Master,

27:53.280 --> 27:54.760
news was scarce at Yuhua Temple.

27:55.320 --> 27:55.920
Do you know

27:56.120 --> 27:57.440
how the Xiao family fares now?

27:57.840 --> 27:59.080
Has General Xiao's name

27:59.280 --> 28:00.200
been cleared?

28:01.680 --> 28:02.640
The entire court

28:02.920 --> 28:04.640
condemned Xiao Zhongwu.

28:05.040 --> 28:06.880
To stabilize the court, His Majesty

28:07.840 --> 28:09.080
declared him guilty soon

28:09.800 --> 28:10.520
and almost

28:10.880 --> 28:12.640
took away Xiao Army's
conscription rights.

28:13.360 --> 28:14.360
How could this happen?

28:14.760 --> 28:16.080
Didn't His Majesty investigate?

28:16.640 --> 28:17.600
General Fengyun,

28:18.240 --> 28:19.280
as fellow generals,

28:19.760 --> 28:21.680
I deeply respect General Xiao.

28:22.560 --> 28:24.120
But in matters of righteousness,

28:24.360 --> 28:25.560
we must not speak falsely.

28:27.240 --> 28:28.120
Righteousness?

28:28.600 --> 28:29.720
Does your righteousness

28:29.720 --> 28:30.920
mean delaying reinforcements

28:31.240 --> 28:32.160
and letting my father,

28:32.640 --> 28:34.720
along with 30,000 Xiao soldiers,

28:35.480 --> 28:37.040
die in vain?

28:38.720 --> 28:40.560
I immediately dispatched troops

28:40.720 --> 28:42.320
upon receiving the distress call,

28:42.400 --> 28:43.920
without any delay.

28:44.560 --> 28:46.640
Had I not turned the tide,

28:47.000 --> 28:48.040
Wutuo's cavalry

28:48.080 --> 28:49.480
would have reached here long ago.

28:52.720 --> 28:54.560
As a witness, General Feihong testified

28:54.920 --> 28:55.800
before His Majesty

28:56.360 --> 28:57.240
and firmly insisted

28:57.320 --> 28:58.520
on Xiao Zhongwu's guilt.

28:59.560 --> 29:01.080
With such crucial witnesses present,

29:01.840 --> 29:02.880
they didn't look further.

29:16.240 --> 29:17.560
He Rufei,

29:18.360 --> 29:19.280
it was you

29:20.000 --> 29:21.600
who delayed reinforcement

29:23.560 --> 29:24.760
and caused my father

29:26.200 --> 29:28.120
and the Xiao Army troops

29:28.440 --> 29:29.640
to perish tragically!

29:31.040 --> 29:32.440
Childhood classmates first,

29:33.320 --> 29:34.120
and then

29:34.400 --> 29:36.000
frontier commanders.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.640
He Rufei,

29:41.560 --> 29:43.000
after all these years apart,

29:45.840 --> 29:47.800
why did you become so wretched?

30:30.040 --> 30:31.040
(With my mask off)

30:32.160 --> 30:33.720
(and my ties with the He family cut,)

30:34.880 --> 30:35.720
(from now on,)

30:36.440 --> 30:37.680
(I am simply He Yan.)

30:39.400 --> 30:40.520
(In this vast world,)

30:41.320 --> 30:42.960
(I'm no longer anyone's substitute.)

30:46.200 --> 30:48.080
(He Rufei stole my title
as General Feihong,)

30:48.600 --> 30:50.720
(tried to kill me, and ruined my name.)

30:51.560 --> 30:53.160
(I won't let him off.)

30:57.200 --> 30:58.320
(I will return to the army)

30:58.960 --> 30:59.960
(and honorably)

31:00.640 --> 31:02.080
(reclaim everything that's mine.)

31:14.550 --> 31:19.710
(Yezhou Garrison)

32:05.440 --> 32:06.000
Thank you.

32:22.150 --> 32:24.310
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:24.410 --> 32:28.330
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:28.510 --> 32:30.450
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:30.540 --> 32:35.470
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

32:47.570 --> 32:48.980
♪I've seen the mountains♪

32:49.180 --> 32:50.590
♪And trodden through ice♪

32:50.860 --> 32:53.670
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

32:53.980 --> 32:55.370
♪Destiny is my creed♪

32:55.430 --> 32:56.830
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

32:56.980 --> 32:58.770
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

32:59.970 --> 33:01.440
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:01.610 --> 33:02.900
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:03.080 --> 33:05.470
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:05.670 --> 33:07.720
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:08.850 --> 33:10.680
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:12.640 --> 33:15.560
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:15.650 --> 33:18.310
♪There must always be a longing♪

33:18.770 --> 33:23.830
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

33:24.160 --> 33:26.170
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:26.480 --> 33:30.130
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:30.370 --> 33:32.260
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:32.290 --> 33:36.140
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:36.490 --> 33:38.430
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

33:38.610 --> 33:42.440
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

33:42.690 --> 33:48.440
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

33:49.330 --> 33:54.800
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

